{"id":17,"date":"2007-11-11T10:37:36","date_gmt":"2007-11-11T10:37:36","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/2007\/11\/11\/lua-le-nouveau-basic\/"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:20:23","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:20:23","slug":"lua-le-nouveau-basic","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2007\/11\/11\/lua-le-nouveau-basic\/","title":{"rendered":"Lua, le nouveau Basic"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.lua.org\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.lua.org\/images\/logo.gif\" align=\"left\" height=\"128\" hspace=\"3\" vspace=\"3\" width=\"128\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Me suis mis \u00e0 programmer un peu en <a href=\"http:\/\/www.lua.org\">Lua<\/a>, un \u00ab\u00a0langage de script\u00a0\u00bb <a href=\"http:\/\/www.lua.org\/uses.html\">tr\u00e8s utilis\u00e9 dans les jeux video<\/a>, mais aussi par <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ozone3d.net\/hyp\/\" target=\"_blank\">Hyperion<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>LUA pr\u00e9sente plusieurs caract\u00e9ristiques \u00e9tonnantes:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>il est tr\u00e8s rapide, presque autant que JAVA mais environ 6x plus que Python ou 15x plus que PHP (voir <a href=\"http:\/\/www.timestretch.com\/FractalBenchmark.html\">ici <\/a>par exemple)<\/li>\n<li>l&rsquo;interpr\u00e9teur LUA est tr\u00e8s petit : moins de 100k, contre 800k pour Python et beaucoup plus pour les autres langages.<\/li>\n<li>LUA est \u00e0 la fois un langage tr\u00e8s simple, genre \u00ab\u00a0Basic des ann\u00e9es 80&prime;\u00a0\u00bb, et offre des notions beaucoup plus avanc\u00e9es d\u00e9crites plus bas<\/li>\n<li>LUA est le premier langage de programmation brazilio-catholique : il a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9 \u00e0 la <a href=\"http:\/\/www.puc-rio.br\/\">Pontif\u00edcia Universidade Cat\u00f3lica do Rio de Janeiro<\/a> et est donc mieux document\u00e9 en portugais qu&rsquo;en fran\u00e7ais.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><em>(lire <a href=\"http:\/\/drgoulu.wordpress.com\/2007\/09\/21\/lua-le-nouveau-basic\/\" target=\"_blank\">la suite sur le blog du Dr. Goulu<\/a>)<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Me suis mis \u00e0 programmer un peu en Lua, un \u00ab\u00a0langage de script\u00a0\u00bb tr\u00e8s utilis\u00e9 dans les jeux video, mais<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[17,22],"class_list":["post-17","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-lua","tag-programmation"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=17"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1814,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17\/revisions\/1814"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=17"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=17"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=17"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}